WEBVTT

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.490
Hey, have you ever heard stories 
about the outside world?

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:18.490
A place where only people with 
blank books like us can go...

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:22.060
But they say that if you go outside, 
you'll be surrounded by deep fog.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:24.330
You'll get lost if you go alone.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:28.250
Then why don't we go together?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:31.890
One person might get lost alone, 
but if two people hold hands,

00:00:31.890 --> 00:00:34.010
if nothing else, they won't get separated.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:40.940
Then give me one of the millet 
dumplings you're holding on to.

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.520
Sure. But I don't like having servants.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.320
How about we be brother 
and sister, then?

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.670
Brother and sister...

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:57.670
My name's Tao. And from
 now on, I'm your brother.

00:00:57.670 --> 00:00:58.410
Got it?

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:03.160
All right. Let's do this together, Brother Tao.

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:12.000
A lot's happened, but now it's 
time to say goodbye to Onigashima.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:46.520
The Brother and Sister of Onigashima

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:46.520
The place looks peaceful.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.370
You're sure there's a Chaos Teller here?

00:02:48.370 --> 00:02:50.770
Yes. This time, I'm sure.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.940
Brother Tao?

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.400
Don't worry. I'm fine.

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.640
Something wrong, you two?

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.370
Listen up, you oni!

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.080
Oni are the enemy! I'll defeat you!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.680
What's this?

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:13.630
Hey, Momotaro!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.670
Those aren't oni! Get back!

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:17.920
Connect!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:24.010
The likes of you cannot defeat me!

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.900
Good grief.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.020
W-Wow...

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:38.530
You didn't need us, huh?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.740
Say, Tao... You just called that boy Momotaro.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:45.420
He's the main character of the place 
where Brother Tao and I were born.

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.350
Of course he knows him.

00:03:47.350 --> 00:03:48.450
The place you were born?

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:52.460
I was so moved by the way you fought!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:57.920
Please, lend me your power!

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.920
So this is Momotaro's Story Zone?

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:08.870
Once upon a time, there lived an old couple.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:12.020
One day, the old man went into 
the mountains to gather firewood,

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.070
and the old woman went to 
the river to do the washing.

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.410
As she was working on the shore,

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:21.620
a gigantic peach came bobbing down the river.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:27.260
When they cut it open, 
they found a boy inside!

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:31.830
When he grew up, he took the millet 
dumplings the old woman made for him,

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.960
and headed to Onigashima. 
Or so the story goes.

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:37.960
So that's the plot of this Story Zone?

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:42.170
Yeah. It's a dump, with oni and 
humans fight an unending battle.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.180
Then, you're heading to Onigashima?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.180
No, I already went and defeated the oni there.

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:50.870
But the survivors joined up 
with the monsters you just saw,

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.140
and are regaining their strength.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:57.380
But Momo, where are the dog, monkey, 
and pheasant who helped you?

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.560
Well, you see...

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.940
They won so much glory for themselves

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.820
<b>Best in Japan</b>

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.820
that they now insult me behind my back...

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.320
I've never heard of a Momotaro

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.200
who was less impressive than 
the dog, monkey, and pheasant.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.150
So the oni are working with the Chaos Teller?

00:05:12.150 --> 00:05:15.160
Or maybe someone on Onigashima 
turned into the Chaos Teller?

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.160
Either way, we need to hurry.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:19.610
Yeah.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.050
The color of the sky...

00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:24.550
We don't have long before
 this Story Zone collapses.

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:28.800
If this is your homeland, do you know
 someone we can ask for help?

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:29.840
Not happening.

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.960
I learned on my journey 
that time flows differently

00:05:32.960 --> 00:05:35.240
inside and outside of a Story Zone.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:39.520
It seems like a lot of time 
has passed here since we left.

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:44.400
I guess when you leave a Story Zone, 
you never really get to come back.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.700
I see.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:50.480
Anyway, if this is your homeland, Sir Tao,

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:53.320
please help me!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.870
I'll give you millet dumplings 
in exchange! Please take them!

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:01.920
The Tao Family isn't so cheap 
that you can buy us off with...

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:03.460
That's right!

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:08.680
We don't come cheap!

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:16.390
W-Well... it's smarter to stay 
with the main character anyway!

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:18.600
Oh, fine. Who are we to argue?

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.970
Then let's head to Onigashima.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.060
No.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:25.320
First, we need to take out 
the oni's hidden village up ahead.

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:36.160
They're planning on using boats 
to attack the coastal villages.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.750
Those boats seem a little small for that...

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.870
And they don't have any weapons.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.400
Don't let your guard down!

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.850
Oni are dangerous, bloodthirsty monsters!

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.380
They're the scourge of humans everywhere.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:52.140
I don't think you can be sure somebody's 
bad just because they're an oni.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.360
That's not true at all!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:56.520
I've never seen or even 
heard of an oni that wasn't.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:01.380
That's Onihime!

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.370
Onihime?

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:04.970
She's the princess of the oni.
 If we crush her...

00:07:04.970 --> 00:07:06.860
Let's go, everyone!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:07.940
Hey, Momo!

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:11.780
Let's end her here!

00:07:12.340 --> 00:07:13.070
What?

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.080
Is that Momotaro?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.820
Good, those other monsters aren't here!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:24.420
Onihime, prepare to die!

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:31.380
Sorry, Momo. Just take a little nap for now.

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:35.180
Sir Tao... Why?

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.140
Who are you?

00:07:38.890 --> 00:07:41.390
It's been a long time, Onihime.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:45.030
Oh, I'm sorry...

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:47.940
You just remind me a lot of another Onihime.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:49.330
You're...

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.990
I've heard of you,

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.870
the oni girl with no horns and no fate.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.740
Oh, I didn't know there 
were any girls like that.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:03.080
Anyway, what are those boats for?

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:06.250
These boats are our hope.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.600
Our hope to return to our home,

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.880
which has been destroyed by 
generations of Momotaros.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.830
Then you don't intend to attack humans?

00:08:13.830 --> 00:08:15.890
We've lost too many people.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.720
Our priority now is 
rebuilding our daily lives.

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:22.530
It seems like you're mostly done.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.530
We'll help you.

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:30.230
Let's book it to Onigashima 
before Momo wakes up.

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:31.490
Brother Tao?

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:34.740
Humans... are willing to help us?

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.670
We've got work to do there.

00:08:36.670 --> 00:08:38.740
Missy, kid, you guys are fine with it, right?

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.160
I'm with you, Tao.

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.410
We're all in the same boat, literally.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.310
Then it's decided!

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.180
Where's Sir Tao? And where are the oni?

00:08:57.480 --> 00:09:00.390
They fled to Onigashima.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.310
What are you doing here, grandfather?

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:07.730
You're our boy!

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:10.980
I was worried, so I came to check on you.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.870
I-I see.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.240
Anyway, this Tao fellow...

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:19.490
He's a dangerous man. 
He did something terrible in the past.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.200
Something terrible?

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:25.940
Rifles?

00:09:25.940 --> 00:09:27.920
Where did the oni get those?

00:09:31.660 --> 00:09:33.120
We're this close...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.510
Boss, I...

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.140
Tao, I...

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:44.600
I swear I...

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.690
He betrayed the last Momotaro?

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:50.010
That's right.

00:09:50.010 --> 00:09:54.110
He pretended to be on his side 
until the very last moment.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:56.240
That's horrible...

00:09:56.410 --> 00:10:03.870
After his betrayal, the last Momotaro 
was surrounded and killed by the oni.

00:10:03.870 --> 00:10:06.370
Sir Tao did that to the last Momotaro?

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:11.470
Momotaro... No, the Tao who 
betrayed us is a hated enemy!

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:14.590
That's right! He's an oni with a human face!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.680
A oni with... a human face?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:21.680
That's right. We'll never truly
 be at peace until he's stopped.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:26.520
But without the dog, monkey, 
and pheasant, I can't...

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:27.890
Don't worry.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.770
I'll grant you new servants.

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.630
I'm glad the water's calm.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:41.820
Yes, we should be there soon.

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:45.830
What's wrong, Tao?

00:10:46.230 --> 00:10:47.980
Nah, it's nothing.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.560
<i>So I ended up back here after all, huh?</i>

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:05.890
So, where to now?

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.740
If we follow the coast eastward, we'll come

00:11:07.740 --> 00:11:09.980
to what was once the 
largest village on the island.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:13.850
There should be a small band
of surviving oni still there.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.360
You stay here and watch the boats.

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:17.690
But, Princess...

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.960
We may need those boats yet.

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:22.570
You needn't worry about me.

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.910
Understood.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.330
Please be safe.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.500
You said that man is Sir Tao?

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:32.210
I remember that name...

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.800
Hey, look over there!

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:34.590
Smoke?

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.460
That's where the village is!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.430
What an awful thing to do.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.860
Who could have done this?

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.300
It was me!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.970
Momo! What are you doing here?

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.730
These are my new servants!

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.720
Servants?

00:11:55.720 --> 00:11:59.860
I have even more now that I've 
added the villagers to their ranks.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:01.660
You turned the oni into those things?

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:06.240
The ones you left on the beach are 
probably my servants by now, too.

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:07.280
What?

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.710
Onihime, get back to your friends.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.210
There may still be time.

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:12.370
R-Right!

00:12:12.550 --> 00:12:13.470
You won't get away!

00:12:13.470 --> 00:12:14.710
Not so fast.

00:12:15.740 --> 00:12:19.550
So it's true you're working with the oni.

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:21.640
What is he talking about?

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:26.050
He killed the last Momotaro!

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:27.110
No way...

00:12:27.110 --> 00:12:29.170
You killed the last Momotaro?

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:33.510
Since he's not denying it,

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:35.230
it must be true.

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:37.110
Yeah, you're right.

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:37.820
Tao!

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.110
You could say it's my fault he's dead.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.070
Brother Tao...

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:51.580
So you admit it, do you?

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.360
Now you all understand, right?

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:56.730
He thinks nothing of betraying his own.

00:12:57.320 --> 00:12:59.710
I'm afraid this isn't something
 I can just overlook.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:00.800
I'm right, aren't I?

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:03.840
No. I meant the fact that 
you just insulted Brother Tao.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.760
What?

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:06.930
After all the traveling I've done with him,

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.930
I know Tao would never betray his friends!

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:12.950
Momotaro, what about you?

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:16.020
Why did you make the villains that 
were your enemies into your servants?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.360
Why won't you believe me?!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:20.950
I'm Momotaro!

00:13:20.950 --> 00:13:22.860
I'm always right!

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:24.730
I see.

00:13:24.730 --> 00:13:26.360
I heard about you, too.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.240
You were an oni of Onigashima!

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:35.040
Of course, when I lived here, I was all 
alone because I didn't have horns.

00:13:35.230 --> 00:13:38.540
The fact that he's working 
with an oni like you...

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:41.620
is proof he's a traitor!

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:43.300
Wait, Momo.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:46.240
I don't like talking about the past,

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:48.050
but just listen for a second.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.090
Once upon a time, there was a boy

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:55.590
who was given no role by the Storyteller.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:58.870
The people around him despised him,

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:01.770
but he dreamed of the day when 
he could help the main character.

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.230
And so he trained.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:10.620
Then one day, he saw Momotaro 
and his servants walking down the road.

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:15.500
The boy raced out in front 
of them, bowed, and begged...

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:19.630
"Momotaro, make me your partner!"

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:24.240
Momotaro took a liking to the kid 
and gave him a new name. Tao.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.090
He made him his partner.

00:14:26.270 --> 00:14:30.120
And you betrayed him!

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:32.500
Calm down. There's more to the story.

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.310
We're this close...

00:14:37.840 --> 00:14:40.570
Boss, I...

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.990
Tao, I...

00:14:46.180 --> 00:14:48.570
I swear I...

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.620
I won't let you die here!

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:56.080
Wait, boss! I'll fight with you to the end!

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:56.950
No!

00:14:57.960 --> 00:15:01.580
I told you... you're my friend!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.270
My family!

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:04.800
Fight! Survive!

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.000
I cannot have you die here!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:08.800
But...

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.680
Go!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:19.440
Boss!

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:29.150
That's right... I'm responsible 
for the death of the last Momotaro.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:35.710
His fate changed because 
he got involved with me

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:38.110
and my blank Book of Fate.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:39.790
Brother Tao...

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:43.000
No... That's impossible...

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.320
I can't believe that after 
all that's happened!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.590
We're done talking.

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:49.090
I'm going to fulfill my duty as Momotaro.

00:15:49.870 --> 00:15:51.380
Stop it, Momo!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:55.640
Go, my new servants! Slay them!

00:15:56.550 --> 00:15:58.020
What are you doing?

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.190
What's wrong? They're the enemy, not me!

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.940
Looks like you need my help.

00:16:10.380 --> 00:16:11.200
Is that...

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.660
That's Momotaro's...

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:15.470
It seems the new servants I gave you

00:16:15.470 --> 00:16:19.040
have sensed the weakness in your heart.

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:22.670
You gave me? No, grandpa did...

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.050
We're one and the same!

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:30.800
A m-monster!

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:32.410
Oh?

00:16:32.410 --> 00:16:38.010
How can you call the old couple 
who raised you a monster?

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.430
What's that?

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:46.480
The Chaos Teller!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.900
Momotaro's grandma and grandpa?

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:51.540
You changed...

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:55.410
Ever since I brought back that 
treasure chest from Onigashima...

00:16:57.730 --> 00:17:04.000
Since you won't do it, I'll kill them 
with a single strike of my magic!

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:08.830
Granny, magic is too good for them!

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:12.630
We should crush them with this iron club!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:15.610
Sir Tao, please defeat that monster!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:20.590
I don't know who I'm supposed to fight anymore...

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:25.580
If we defeat it and do the tuning,

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.950
everything will go back to how it was before.

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.980
Back to a world where humans and oni fight.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.390
But we don't have any other choice.

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:35.740
Yeah, I know that.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.800
Tao, we're with you.

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:41.620
I've never forgotten how you 
took me with you that day!

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.790
Just watch me, boss!

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:46.870
This is how the Tao family fights!

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.010
Snow White!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:49.070
Cinderella!

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:50.540
Queen of the Poison Apple!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.670
John Silver!

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.300
Connect!

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:04.680
All righty, time to send you 
to Davy Jones's locker.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:09.440
My servants! Kill all of these impudent fools

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.690
who would side with the oni!

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:16.040
Mirror, mirror, on the wall!

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.700
I'll open a path for you!

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.540
Tao, now!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.260
Right!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.670
Here they come, grandpa.

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:29.790
I'm on it!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:34.920
H-He blocked my club?!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:36.010
How?!

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:40.510
I don't want to make the same mistake 
I made on this island last time!

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:44.760
My club!

00:18:44.760 --> 00:18:45.720
In that case...

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:52.020
Endless Voyages and Greed!

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:56.650
My flame!

00:18:58.600 --> 00:19:00.530
Damn you!

00:19:00.710 --> 00:19:02.530
Prepare to die!

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.040
How pathetic...

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.050
I turned my grandparents into that thing,

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:20.250
and failed to achieve glory 
greater than my predecessor...

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:23.890
Momo, there's one thing I need to tell you.

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:29.480
The Momotaro I knew never 
fought for his own glory.

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:32.730
Do it, missy.

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.730
Return this story to its proper form...

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:43.150
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:47.660
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:01.430
We're about to attack the village!

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.710
Are you ready, everyone?

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.600
Let's teach them a lesson!

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:10.330
The battle between oni and 
humans will begin anew, huh?

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.560
Did we really do the right thing?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:15.470
There's no sense in 
thinking about it anymore.

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:17.200
We're just travelers.

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:20.980
Once we fix the damage caused 
by the Chaos Teller, it's time to leave.

00:20:20.980 --> 00:20:24.240
Whether or not Tao accepts that, I don't know...

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.530
What was that about me, missy?

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:31.040
I know this area well, 
so I grabbed us peaches and nuts.

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:33.790
I got us fish, too.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.950
Oh, my gosh! That's so nice of you!

00:20:36.950 --> 00:20:38.550
Tao... Shane...

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:41.140
Come on, don't look so glum.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:42.940
Sorry.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:46.050
Um... thank you.

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:50.310
Wh-Why are you thanking me?

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:54.520
For saying you believed in Brother Tao.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:58.910
You can be pretty passionate 
at times, huh, new kid?

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:03.890
One person might get lost alone, 
but two won't get separated.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:05.070
So if there are four of us...

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.570
If there are four of us?

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.410
It's nothing.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.600
Forget that! Let's eat!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.450
Oh, I need to start a fire!

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:15.790
I'll help, Reina.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:21.470
If there's four of us, 
maybe we can go wherever we want.

00:21:25.750 --> 00:21:29.640
Hey, boss... We can win tomorrow, right?

00:21:29.840 --> 00:21:34.080
Nobody really knows what tomorrow will bring.

00:21:34.080 --> 00:21:39.020
But your Book of Fate says so, right?

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:42.650
Yet it didn't say anything about you.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:47.230
It's possible our fate has already changed.

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:50.950
However, there's one thing I do know.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:55.100
Tao, you're one of us.

00:21:55.100 --> 00:21:55.970
You're family.

00:21:55.970 --> 00:21:56.960
Boss...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:00.290
But family isn't a place to belong forever.

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:05.590
One day you must leave us 
and find new connections.

00:22:06.120 --> 00:22:10.600
Right now, I can't even 
imagine leaving you guys.

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.250
Is that so?

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:18.350
Perhaps you're right, then.
 Nobody knows what tomorrow may bring.

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:24.380
But should you find those connections, 
never let them go.

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:27.800
<i>I know that, boss.</i>

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:33.150
Okay, Tao family, let's eat!
